{"t":"ISRG","made":"2026-11-28 02:27","name":"Intuitive Surgical, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","employees":17021,"hq":"Sunnyvale, CA, United States","website":"https://www.intuitive.com","summary_en":"Intuitive Surgical, Inc. develops, manufactures, and markets products that enable physicians and healthcare providers to enhance the quality of and access to minimally invasive care in the United States and internationally. It offers the da Vinci Surgical System that enables surgical procedures using a minimally invasive approach; and Ion endoluminal system, which extends its commercial offerings beyond surgery into diagnostic endoluminal procedures enabling minimally invasive biopsies in the lung. The company also provides a suite of stapling, energy, and core instrumentation for its multi-port da Vinci surgical systems; progressive learning pathways to support the use of its technology; infrastructure of customer service and support specialists, a complement of services to its customers, including installation, repair, maintenance, 24/7 technical support, and proactive system health monitoring; and integrated digital capabilities providing connected offerings, streamlining performance for hospitals with program-enhancing insights. It sells its products through direct sales organizations, such as capital and clinical sales teams. Intuitive Surgical, Inc. was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Sunnyvale, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Intuitive Surgical, Inc.는 미국 및 전 세계에서 의사와 의료 서비스 제공자가 최소 침습 치료의 품질과 접근성을 향상시킬 수 있는 제품을 개발, 제조 및 판매합니다. 최소 침습적 접근법을 사용하여 수술 절차를 가능하게 하는 da Vinci 수술 시스템을 제공합니다. 그리고 상업용 제품을 수술을 넘어 폐에서 최소 침습 생검을 가능하게 하는 진단 관내 시술로 확장하는 이온 관내 시스템. 또한 이 회사는 다중 포트 da Vinci 수술 시스템을 위한 스테이플링, 에너지 및 핵심 장비 제품군을 제공합니다. 기술 사용을 지원하는 점진적인 학습 경로; 고객 서비스 및 지원 전문가의 인프라, 설치, 수리, 유지 관리, 연중무휴 기술 지원 및 사전 시스템 상태 모니터링을 포함하여 고객을 위한 보완적인 서비스; 연결된 제품을 제공하고 프로그램을 강화하는 통찰력으로 병원의 성과를 간소화하는 통합 디지털 기능입니다. 캐피탈영업팀, 임상영업팀 등 직접판매 조직을 통해 제품을 판매하고 있다. Intuitive Surgical, Inc.는 1995년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 서니베일에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":430.42,"mcap":149202386944.0,"pe":52.045948,"fpe":34.517742,"peg":1.7971,"ps":12.886715,"pb":9.332004,"ev_ebitda":32.247,"div":0.0,"beta":1.439,"hi52":603.88,"lo52":328.57},"fin":{"rev":11578000384.0,"rev_g":0.217,"eps_g":-0.236,"gross":0.66642,"op":0.31702,"net":0.25542,"roe":0.17932,"fcf":3434800128.0,"cash":4042500096.0,"debt":0.0,"de":null,"eps":8.27,"feps":12.46953},"own":{"short":0.020299999,"inst":0.88682,"insider":0.0053399997},"analyst":{"n":31,"mean":487.71805,"median":500.0,"high":685.0,"low":324.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.71429,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":7,"buy":20,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":7,"buy":19,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":7,"buy":17,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":7,"buy":17,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Leerink Partners","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":503.0,"priorPriceTarget":473.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":475.0,"priorPriceTarget":450.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":385.0,"priorPriceTarget":400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":486.0,"priorPriceTarget":487.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":485.0,"priorPriceTarget":485.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21"